{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "brazilian", "appid": 924970, "month": "2026-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1769904000, "end_date": 1772323199, "month_true_total": 20, "quota": 20, "returned": 20, "pulled_at": "2026-08-30 19:38:24 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "219477040", "author": {"steamid": "76561199883446879", "personaname": "$fallenx$", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HAZARDGAMERCLT/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 723, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 450, "last_played": 1780786054, "avatar": "1ac23d8adfd63771e61c05911a7c3850f8ed3a5b"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "parece call of duty\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1772311250, "timestamp_updated": 1772311250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219385826", "author": {"steamid": "76561199309868751", "personaname": "Ana", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199309868751/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 440, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 185, "last_played": 1782638046, "avatar": "f3197852a4f288b5bdf9b282a8eda797c47c26a7"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Jogo bom, mas dificil.", "timestamp_created": 1772231283, "timestamp_updated": 1772231283, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219216390", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095114935", "personaname": "Allan", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/allan_pereira2/", "num_games_owned": 560, "num_reviews": 109, "playtime_forever": 2665, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2376, "last_played": 1780801196, "avatar": "ab8368ae14dd1b4db90dfe70b9d28cc684fa6b4d"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Se pensa que o game é apenas atirar em monstros, você esta enganado. o game possui uma mecânica com aprimoramento de armas e combinações de cartas e efeito (deck) eu honestamente gostei do gráfico e a história. recomendo jogar, principalmente em coop, facilita muito, tive um trabalho para platinar o game mas deve ser mais fácil jogando coop com os amigos.", "timestamp_created": 1772045720, "timestamp_updated": 1772045720, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219121389", "author": {"steamid": "76561198355177685", "personaname": "Alpha_Kings", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198355177685/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4266, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 108, "playtime_at_review": 2425, "last_played": 1787679615, "avatar": "eb90d0182e15fd3580babc6d131da7cbf89b0643"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Jogo maravilhoso", "timestamp_created": 1771943817, "timestamp_updated": 1771943817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "219093677", "author": {"steamid": "76561198958230521", "personaname": "eduardobecker2000", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198958230521/", "num_games_owned": 71, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 225, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 201, "last_played": 1776573358, "avatar": "932223602ee9e4bdbc276c99c8d75c96a6d6515d"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "🎮 Análise – 3 horas de Back 4 Blood\r\n\r\nCom 3 horas de jogo, posso dizer que Back 4 Blood é divertido — principalmente com amigos.\r\n\r\nO ritmo é intenso, tem bastante ação e o sistema de cartas adiciona uma camada estratégica interessante, dando variedade às builds e às partidas. A cooperação realmente faz diferença, e quando o time encaixa, o caos vira pura adrenalina.\r\n\r\nDito isso, ainda sinto que ele fica um passo atrás de World War Z. WWZ passa uma sensação maior de escala e impacto, principalmente nas hordas gigantes que impressionam visualmente e na fluidez geral do combate.\r\n\r\nBack 4 Blood diverte, sim — mas brilha mesmo quando jogado em squad. Solo ele perde um pouco da graça.\r\n\r\n🔥 Resumo: Não supera WWZ pra mim, mas é um ótimo game pra juntar os amigos e sair descarregando munição contra hordas.\r\n\r\nNota após 3h: 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1771907108, "timestamp_updated": 1771907108, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218951490", "author": {"steamid": "76561198198559901", "personaname": "Shennou", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198198559901/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 3685, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3685, "last_played": 1729616264, "avatar": "a55cc6d76a3d981ddca1172677f57886a2167262"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Sucessor espiritual de Left 4 Dead 2. O jogo me agradou bastante, inclusive com a nova mecânica de deck (que pode desagradar alguns). Personagens carismáticos, dublagem PT-BR e um bom jogo coop pra jogar com um grupo de amigos. O jogo tem crossplay.", "timestamp_created": 1771764787, "timestamp_updated": 1771764787, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497925341129302979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218919985", "author": {"steamid": "76561198742990177", "personaname": "Not_Sora", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198742990177/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 419, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 246, "last_played": 1771981902, "avatar": "038245943238eb5146b54a869d8336bb6a11bbcf"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Jogo e divertido recomendo e um left for dead bem melhor , como mais  coisas para fazer", "timestamp_created": 1771729991, "timestamp_updated": 1771729991, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218541423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032524810", "personaname": "VegetaExtreme (Rodrigo)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032524810/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 996, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 996, "last_played": 1769289598, "avatar": "44ef5ef610bebe3f11e717134b2739